{"name":"Guesthouse","hex":"#e3e0d2","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"guesthouse","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A small house near a main house, for lodging visitors.","A private house offering accommodation to paying guests; a boarding house; a bed and breakfast."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/guesthouse"}],"entries":[{"title":"Guest house","blocks":[{"text":"A guest house is a kind of lodging. In some parts of the world, a guest house is a type of inexpensive hotel-like lodging. In others, it is a private home that has been converted for the exclusive use of visitor accommodation. The owner usually lives in an entirely separate area within the property and the guest house may be as a form of lodging business."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b2/LPB_Guest_Houses_%281490224551%29.jpg/330px-LPB_Guest_Houses_%281490224551%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guest_house","wikidata":"Q2460422"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/Altm%C3%B5isa_k%C3%BClalistemaja.jpg/500px-Altm%C3%B5isa_k%C3%BClalistemaja.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/Altm%C3%B5isa_k%C3%BClalistemaja.jpg/1280px-Altm%C3%B5isa_k%C3%BClalistemaja.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/Altm%C3%B5isa_k%C3%BClalistemaja.jpg/500px-Altm%C3%B5isa_k%C3%BClalistemaja.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":" Guest House Altmõisa in Estonia. Tuuru village","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAltm%C3%B5isa_k%C3%BClalistemaja.jpg"}],"sounds":{"guesthouse":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/88/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Veal